A multisport parent (isMultiSportParent true) is restored as the Garmin Connect web app does it: DELETE v2 reconstruct without a body. Garmin answers 202 and applies the restore in a few seconds.
-- args --
activity
restore
12345678
-- route GET /activity-service/activity/12345678 --
{"activityId":12345678,"activityName":"Triathlon","isMultiSportParent":true,"activityTypeDTO":{"typeId":89,"typeKey":"multi_sport"},"metadataDTO":{"childIds":[12345001,12345002,12345003],"trimmed":false},"summaryDTO":{"startTimeGMT":"2026-01-10T08:00:00.0","elapsedDuration":8000.0}}
-- route DELETE /activity-service/activity/v2/12345678/reconstruct 202 --
-- table stdout --
-- table stderr --
Restored the original of multisport activity 12345678
-- table exit --
0
-- table requests --
GET /activity-service/activity/12345678
DELETE /activity-service/activity/v2/12345678/reconstruct
-- plain stdout --
-- plain stderr --
Restored the original of multisport activity 12345678
-- plain exit --
0
-- plain requests --
GET /activity-service/activity/12345678
DELETE /activity-service/activity/v2/12345678/reconstruct
-- plain-header stdout --
-- plain-header stderr --
Restored the original of multisport activity 12345678
-- plain-header exit --
0
-- plain-header requests --
GET /activity-service/activity/12345678
DELETE /activity-service/activity/v2/12345678/reconstruct
